    },
    {
        "text": "Meow! My notes... My tail... All fine. Thank heavens!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Scholar"
    },
    {
        "text": "Where are we? It's dark here...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Scholar"
    },
    {
        "text": "Corne...! Noir Corne! Are you still alive?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Scholar"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mrrow... I can only see half your body there. Noir Corne, don't die...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Scholar"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm okay... but could you stop tugging on my leg?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "text": "I have a lamp in my equipment bag. Turn it on.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "text": "Lamp? What's that? Mew mean this thing?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Scholar"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yeah, now flip the switch at the bottom.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$darkness01_intro",
        "key": "$darkness01_loop",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_752_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$MH_nekoinjured"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mrow! That's bright! But it's not hot at all... How do you do it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Scholar"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Another thing. My horn... It's stuck in this rock. Could you come help me out?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_752_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$MH_nekohappy02"
    },
    {
        "text": "Your horn's... stuck in the rock...! Meowhahaha!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Scholar"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey! Don't laugh!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_752_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$MH_nekotalk"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm on meow way.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Scholar"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Climb up from over there. Ahh! Don't climb <i>me</i>! And definitely don't grab <i>that</i>!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "text": "Here I am... Is this where you're stuck? Wham!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Scholar"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.8,
        "xstrength": 50,
        "ystrength": 50,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$bodyfalldown1",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_clothmovement",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#6$1",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Oww... My butt.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Where's the Rathalos? Did you see it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_752_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$MH_nekotalk"
    },
    {
        "text": "It went inside.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Scholar"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "The opening of this cave's too high up. It'd take us too much work to climb up without help. We need to find a way to signal Yato, but we also can't lose track of the Rathalos...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wait, where are we anyway?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_752_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I was going to ask mew!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Scholar"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Rathalos went down the cave, and the cave only further down... Maybe it's connected to the one closer to the village. Looks like we'll have to head that way to check it out.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey, Scholar! Wait up! What's the rush?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_752_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$MH_nekotalk"
    },
    {
        "text": "Meow! We need to hurry!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Scholar"
    },
    {
        "text": "There are so meowny mysteries! The laws of nature here aren't all that diffurent from where we're from, but there are all these situations I can't wrap my head around! The Rathalos is acting way too oddly!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Scholar"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oddly? That new Felyne mentioned something about it being abnormal, too.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_752_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll explain to mew as we walk!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Scholar"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Rathalos burrowed itself down here... Purrhaps the cause of its odd behavior can be found here, too!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Scholar"
    },
    {
        "text": "I swear this on the name of a furmer Royal Pawleontology Scriveners scholar! I will get to the bottom of this!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Scholar"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
