        "time": 2.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_752_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$MH_nekotalk"
    },
    {
        "text": "Noir Corne... come check this out.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Scholar"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_752_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#5$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm coming\u2014Goodness, this stinks... Huh?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_752_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#6$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Scholar... Are these...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_752_1#2$1",
        "name2": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#6$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "All animal carcasses... all shredded and torn apart by the Rathalos.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Scholar"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_752_1#2$1",
        "name2": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#6$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Shellbeasts, hornbeasts, fowlbeasts... so many different beasts... Did it kill all these animals for food? Are these... leftovers?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_752_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#6$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "No, a Rathalos's bite can crush even bones. There is no way it would leave behind so many carcasses.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Scholar"
    },
    {
        "text": "They all look very complete, too. They were killed, but there are no chew marks or signs of them having been eaten...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Scholar"
    },
    {
        "text": "Come. Let's check out what's up ahead.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Scholar"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_752_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Alright.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
    },
