    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_752_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#1$1",
        "fadetime": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_752_1#4$1",
        "name2": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$MH_nekoinjured"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mrow! How could this be...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Scholar"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_752_1#4$1",
        "name2": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#5$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "What did you find?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_752_1#9$1",
        "name2": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#5$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "The carcasses here have all been burnt to a crisp... They were killed and dragged all the way down here, but it still spat fire at them. There's no way it could've eaten any of these.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Scholar"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_752_1#9$1",
        "name2": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#9$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Is it... angry?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_752_1#9$1",
        "name2": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#9$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Look here. This, this, and this! Not one of them... It didn't eat even a single one of them!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Scholar"
    },
    {
        "text": "Purrhaps... the Rathalos can't eat Terran creatures?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Scholar"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_752_1#9$1",
        "name2": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#9$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Could that explain uh... how it's abnormal?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_752_1#9$1",
        "name2": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#9$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't know... Hunger can change its behavior, but it's hard to say for sure that's the reason...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Scholar"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_752_1#3$1",
        "name2": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#9$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$MH_nekoinjured"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why? I don't get it at all!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Scholar"
    },
    {
        "text": "Based on my observation data, Terran creatures follow the same growth patterns as where we're from. Besides, I ate the same food as you, and there's nothing wrong with me meow!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Scholar"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_752_1#3$1",
        "name2": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#6$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "This is just a guess, but... what if it's not caused by the food, but by the... Originium on its skin?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_752_1#4$1",
        "name2": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#6$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You mean Rathalos caught Oripathy?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Scholar"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_752_1#4$1",
        "name2": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#5$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014! Look at that!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_752_1#4$1",
        "name2": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#5$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "What mrow?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Scholar"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_752_1#4$1",
        "name2": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#6$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Quick! Help me get all these animals out of the way. The dirt, too.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_752_1#5$1",
        "name2": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#6$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$MH_nekoinjured"
    },
    {
        "text": "It stinks! Why can't you do it yourself?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Scholar"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_752_1#5$1",
        "name2": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Well, you tricked me into holding that fincatching rod for you. This is payback.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_752_1#3$1",
        "name2": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$MH_nekoangry"
    },
    {
        "tag": "characteraction",
        "name": "left",
        "type": "jump",
        "times": 1,
        "power": 5,
        "fadetime": 0.5,
        "isblock": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Mrow? *Hiss*... I'm mad! Mad, I tell you, mrow!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Scholar"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_752_1#3$1",
        "name2": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#6$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Wait, cut it out.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "text": "...I think I know why there are those traces of Originium on the Rathalos's body now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_752_1#4$1",
        "name2": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#6$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Are you talking about the holes we're digging? What could they pawssibly imply?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Scholar"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_752_1#4$1",
        "name2": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#7$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "These are tracks left behind by Originium mining. The area underneath is most likely...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "text": "An Originium mine.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "text": "If this mine is why the villagers have been going so far to hide this cave from us, then that would explain everything.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_752_1#9$1",
        "name2": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#7$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Wait! What do you mean? Meow exactly does it explain <i>anything</i>?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Scholar"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_752_1#9$1",
        "name2": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#7$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Considering Higashi's current situation and its dwindling resources... a private Originium mine that's hidden from the outside world could bring them piles of cash even if all they do is sell crude ore.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "text": "But if any outsiders\u2014maybe even greater forces\u2014were to find out about their hidden mine, it could very well get taken over by force. It might even put their lives in danger.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_752_1#9$1",
        "name2": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#7$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "So what you're saying is, Originium is a kind of meowneral that's find in the earth, and the villagers have been digging it up?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Scholar"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_752_1#9$1",
        "name2": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#6$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "That's right.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_752_1#9$1",
        "name2": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#6$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "And you people do that on a regular basis?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Scholar"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_752_1#9$1",
        "name2": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#6$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Yep.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_752_1#5$1",
        "name2": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#6$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "As I recall, you said Originium can cause an incurable disease called Oripathy, or even a cat-astrophic disaster that tears even the land and the sky apart...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Scholar"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_752_1#5$1",
        "name2": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#2$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Exactly.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_752_1#9$1",
        "name2": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#2$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "So why could you pawssibly want to dig it up?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Scholar"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_752_1#9$1",
        "name2": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#7$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Uh... because it's an energy source, I guess?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_752_1#4$1",
        "name2": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#7$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Energy source? You can burn wood and oil for heat, and you can boil water to purr-pel machines. Can't you people do <i>any</i> of that fur energy?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Scholar"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_752_1#9$1",
        "name2": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#7$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$MH_nekoinjured"
    },
    {
        "text": "I can't think of a good reason fur willingly exposing yourselves to something so dangerous!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Scholar"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_752_1#9$1",
        "name2": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#7$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "What did the Doctor say again... We Terrans use Originium through Originium Arts...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "text": "Thanks to advancements in Originium engine technology, Originium became widely used as an industrial energy source. And in the past, it was also often used for casting Arts...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_752_1#9$1",
        "name2": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#5$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't know any Arts, though. How I can explain this to you with something else...? Oh, hand me the light.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_752_1#4$1",
        "name2": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#5$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$MH_nekoinjured"
    },
    {
        "text": "What are mew doing with it? Mrowah! Don't take it apart! You'll purrt it out!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Scholar"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_752_1#4$1",
        "name2": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#2$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Here. This is what I'm talking about.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_752_1#4$1",
        "name2": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#2$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh? It's still lit up?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Scholar"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_752_1#4$1",
        "name2": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#6$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Take a look at this. This is a battery. It's what powers the light bulb up here, and that's how it's lit up.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_752_1#9$1",
        "name2": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#6$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "What does that have to do with Originium?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Scholar"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_752_1#9$1",
        "name2": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#6$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "The battery has Originium in it, too. There's also this... what do you call it... Arts Unit? That's the thing that turns the battery's Originium into electrical currents that light up the bulb.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_752_1#9$1",
        "name2": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#6$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "So it lights up beclawse of Originium?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Scholar"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_752_1#9$1",
        "name2": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#6$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Not only that, the light bulb, the outer shell, and all the parts inside were mass produced in a factory.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_752_1#9$1",
        "name2": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#6$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Mass produced?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Scholar"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_752_1#9$1",
        "name2": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#6$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "It's when you make the same thing over and over on a large scale. Take this exploration lamp. A huge factory can make over a thousand of them in a day.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_752_1#4$1",
        "name2": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#6$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$MH_nekoinjured"
    },
    {
        "text": "A thousand?! That's so convenient! Could the clothes all the villagers wear pawssibly be made in those factories, too?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Scholar"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_752_1#4$1",
        "name2": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#2$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "That's right. The factory uses machines to build these parts, and what's driving those machines is called an Originium engine.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "text": "And they need Originium to function. That's how it is in most places here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_752_1#2$1",
        "name2": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#2$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "So Terra's technology... and even its civilizations are built on a furndation of Originium.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Scholar"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_752_1#2$1",
        "name2": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I guess that's about it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_752_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "But our Hunters don't have lamps, or the kind of clothes mew wear. The lamp is convenient, I'll give mew that...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Scholar"
    },
    {
        "text": "But even without something as dangerous as Originium, we get by just fine.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Scholar"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_752_1#9$1",
        "name2": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "It should be pawssible to replace it with something else here too, shouldn't it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Scholar"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_752_1#9$1",
        "name2": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#5$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Are these Hunters common where you guys are from?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_752_1#8$1",
        "name2": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#5$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course. If we leave the meownsters be, they could pose significant threats to the villagers' safety, and our livelihoods depend on the meowterials you get out of them.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Scholar"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_752_1#8$1",
        "name2": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#5$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "So... are all the hunts these hunters go on safe?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_752_1#2$1",
        "name2": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#5$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "No... Most of the time, there are dangers everywhere. You're more likely to fail a hunt than succeed.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Scholar"
    },
    {
        "text": "And there's only a very small number of truly skilled hunters. When they are up against truly tricky monsters, meowst hunters end up losing their lives.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Scholar"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_752_1#2$1",
        "name2": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#6$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Then our Originium's actually not a whole lot different from your monsters.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_752_1#4$1",
        "name2": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#6$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Mrow? What do you mean?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Scholar"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_752_1#4$1",
        "name2": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#2$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Both Originium and monsters are unpreventable threats, but they both also give us the opportunity to survive.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_752_1#5$1",
        "name2": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#2$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Mrrow...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Scholar"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_752_1#5$1",
        "name2": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#2$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You probably won't see one, but... Catastrophes are actually very common here in Terra. Most folks live in the nomadic cities, and each city can have tens of thousands of residents.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "text": "When a Catastrophe is about to strike, the entire city starts moving.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_752_1#9$1",
        "name2": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#2$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$MH_nekolow"
    },
    {
        "text": "A city with tens of thousands of residents... moving... That sounds moewvelous. How do you move something that big?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Scholar"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_752_1#9$1",
        "name2": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#6$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Originium. Only the energy hidden in Originium can move a nomadic city. No other energy source comes close.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_752_1#9$1",
        "name2": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#6$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I can't believe this, mrow...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Scholar"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_752_1#9$1",
        "name2": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#6$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "We all definitely understand that using Originium can cause Catastrophes.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "text": "But... when Catastrophe strikes, if you want to survive, even if all you have nearby is a twig or branch floating in a puddle, you're bound to grab it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "text": "It doesn't matter if it has thorns... That's the least of your worries.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "text": "Before nomadic cities were invented, before we started using Originium at the scale we do now, many more people died from Catastrophes.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_752_1#5$1",
        "name2": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#6$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$MH_nekolow"
    },
    {
        "text": "Terra... sounds so scary, mrow.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Scholar"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_752_1#5$1",
        "name2": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#6$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Those thorns may end up cutting your fingers, but a Catastrophe's not going to end just because of your pain. You have no choice but to hold on... and hold on for dear life.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "text": "And it doesn't matter how hard you look. Until you find a smooth tree branch that won't cut you, that's all you can do.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_752_1#5$1",
        "name2": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#7$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "It doesn't matter how difficult it all is. You just have to grit your teeth and live on...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_752_1#5$1",
        "name2": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#7$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$MH_nekogood"
    },
    {
        "text": "Noir Corne, I can hardly call you smart just for this, but purrhaps you have a point...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Scholar"
    },
    {
        "text": "Thinking about it now, the difficulties we face aren't all that diffurent.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Scholar"
    },
    {
        "text": "The materials we need to forge weapons that can take on the fiercest beasts likewise come from fierce beasts, and behind that must be a countless number of sacrifices too...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Scholar"
    },
    {
        "text": "There are Hunters who never return from their hunts, Commission members who fall while exploring the New World, and plenty of Scriveners who disappeared without a trace while observing dangerous creatures for data...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Scholar"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_752_1#5$1",
        "name2": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#2$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "*sigh*... looks like no matter where mew are, people are fragile, and the world is a cruel place.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_752_1#5$1",
        "name2": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#2$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$MH_nekogood"
    },
    {
        "text": "But even if all that suffering is inevitable, and you have to pay the price to survive, must innocent lives be sacrificed too?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Scholar"
    },
    {
        "text": "I've never heard of things like that where I'm from... Things like Originium which makes the innocent suffer.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Scholar"
    },
    {
        "text": "They don't catch Oripathy because they wanted to, and they won't even get to live without treatment. How could that pawssibly be right?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Scholar"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_752_1#5$1",
        "name2": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#6$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course it's not right.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_752_1#4$1",
        "name2": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#6$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Mrow! So quick to answer!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Scholar"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_752_1#4$1",
        "name2": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#2$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Which is why somebody has to step forward and take on the burden of showing everyone else the way forward.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Hello? Is anybody there?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_752_1#4$1",
        "name2": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#2$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$MH_nekolow"
    },
    {
        "text": "What's that noise?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Scholar"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_752_1#4$1",
        "name2": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#5$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Did someone just talk?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Stop chatting! Look over here!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "I've been stuck in here for three days now. Could you come over and move the stuff blocking this door?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_752_1#4$1",
        "name2": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#6$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "She's asking us for help... Where are you? We're coming right away!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Whoa, watch out! There's about to be another beast outbreak.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_752_1#4$1",
        "name2": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#9$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Beast outbreak?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "You can more or less figure it out from the name, can't you? It's an outbreak of all the animals in the forest going berserk at once.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_752_1#9$1",
        "name2": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#9$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$MH_nekotalk"
    },
    {
        "text": "I think I hear a familiar noise, too.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Scholar"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_752_1#9$1",
        "name2": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#9$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I can hear it, too. It's not coming again, is it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Whenever you see a surge of animals here, you can bet they're all Infected.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
